o.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904507","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00016","en":"Taichi: \"But you're something necessary to me, Touko.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:000008e8:text","row":39798,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……嘘ばっかり」","en":"“…Lies. Every word.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904508","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00017","en":"Touko: \"...all lies.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:0000091a:text","row":39799,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら」","en":"“Here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904509","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:0000093a:text","row":39800,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"机の上に、指輪ケースを置く。","en":"I set a ring box on the desk.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904510","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00019","en":"I lay a ring case onto her desk.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:000009d7:text","row":39801,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“…!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904511","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00020","en":"Touko: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000a1e:text","row":39802,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「これって？」","en":"“Is this…?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904512","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00021","en":"Touko: \"What's this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000a4c:text","row":39803,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺の、気持ち」","en":"“My… feelings.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904513","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00022","en":"Taichi: \"My... feelings.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000ad5:text","row":39804,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"照れたように視線をそらして。","en":"I looked away, as though embarrassed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904514","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00023","en":"With my gaze averted in embarrassment,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000b11:text","row":39805,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな時代だから」","en":"“In times like these…”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904515","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Because the times are like this.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000b3d:text","row":39806,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"鼻の下をこする。","en":"I rubbed beneath my nose.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904516","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00025","en":"and rubbing under the nose.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000b6d:text","row":39807,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺のブロークンハート、受け取ってくれるだろ？」","en":"“You'll accept my broken heart, won't you?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904517","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00026","en":"Taichi: \"Will you... accept my Broken Heart?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000c3b:text","row":39808,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「……私……でも！」","en":"“…Even… me?!”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904518","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00027","en":"Touko: \"...I... but!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000c6f:text","row":39809,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「いいんだ、何も言うな。俺の気持ちは、言葉じゃ伝わらない」","en":"“It's all right. Don't say anything. Words could never convey how I feel.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904519","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00028","en":"Taichi: \"It's fine, don't say anything. My feelings... cannot be conveyed with words.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000d47:text","row":39810,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一……本当に？」","en":"“Taichi... do you really mean it?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904520","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00029","en":"Touko: \"Taichi... you serious?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000d73:text","row":39811,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"無言で頷く。","en":"I nodded without a word.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904521","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00030","en":"A wordless nod.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000dbc:text","row":39812,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあ……もらおう……かな」","en":"“Then… maybe I'll… take it.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904522","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00031","en":"Touko: \"Then... I'll accept it... maybe.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000df2:text","row":39813,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"そっとケースを持ち上げる。","en":"She lifted the box gently.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904523","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00032","en":"She raises up the ring case delicately.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000e49:text","row":39814,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「あけるね？」","en":"“I'm opening it, okay?”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904524","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00033","en":"Touko: \"I'll open it, OK?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000e77:text","row":39815,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ。俺が、身につけさせてあげるよ」","en":"“Yeah. I'll put it on you myself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904525","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Yep. And then, I will be the one to put this on you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000eda:text","row":39816,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「……やだ、キザ」","en":"“...Oh, stop. You're so corny.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904526","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00035","en":"Touko: \"...but no, so classy!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"Touko calls his behavior cheesy, affected, or pretentiously suave. 'Classy' is positive praise and reverses her teasing criticism.","remedy":"so cheesy!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":19,"text":"so classy!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000f0c:text","row":39817,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「ははは」","en":"“Ha ha ha.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904527","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Hahahah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000fb4:text","row":39818,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふふふ」","en":"“Heh heh.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904528","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00037","en":"Touko: \"Hoh hoh hoh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:00000fd6:text","row":39819,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"そして冬子はゆっくりとケースをあけた。","en":"And Touko slowly opened the box.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904529","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00038","en":"And then slowly Touko opened the ring case.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0304:0000101c:text","row":39820,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“……”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904530","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0014a:00039","en":"Touko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable"